WEBVTT

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.340
Will Rio be attending the
sage's meeting as well?

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.200
Yes, sir.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.710
Indeed?

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:26.900
I hope that the Elders
do not give him a hard time...

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.660
The other day, the
bloodied body of a child

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.980
was found in the red-light district.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.860
Yet rumor claims that this
very child still lives.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.630
This wouldn't be that
one child, would it?

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.010
Well, Rio Satomi?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:52.360
Furthermore, that child has not aged
in the past five years.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:58.420
If he is both immortal and ageless,
then this is the legendary-

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.870
I must apologize for
refuting your statement,

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:04.060
but "immortality" simply does not exist.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:07.270
I am shocked to hear our great sages

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:09.010
refer to him as an ageless immortal

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.130
simply because the lad
suffers from stunted growth.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:19.060
I see you are still an
uncouth whelp, Rio Satomi.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.330
Enough with the drivel.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.520
This is our unanimous consensus.

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:28.020
Summon Shino Inuzuka
before us immediately.

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:32.380
Now then... How to handle this?

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.630
Too good!

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.250
Take yer time. No one's
gonna snatch it up.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:12.950
Karma

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:13.720
Looks like yer back to normal, huh?

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.520
Yep!

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.210
What brought you here?

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:20.430
Weren't you supposed to be laying low
at the manor for a while?

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.990
That had been the plan...

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.910
However, a girl who resides there

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:27.870
is highly sensitive
to the smell of blood.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:32.850
As a result, they were told to hide here
until things settle down.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:34.950
I see...

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.390
Well, I'm glad to have you!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.490
Oh, Megu! Shino's here.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.710
Care to join us?

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:42.490
Geh!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.700
Is it just me, or has it gotten bigger?

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.990
We are celebrating
Shino's recovery today.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.500
You are welcome to eat
as much as you like.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.280
Not my meat! Stop right there!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.280
It has hands...

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.460
Grow nice and big.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:01.380
KONA-YA

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.940
Shino, you may go back to sleep.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.570
Where's Genpachi?

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:13.210
He left for work.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.520
He got a good look at your face
as you slept before leaving.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.420
No wonder I didn't sleep well.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.620
I'm goin' back to sleep.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:22.990
Okay.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.780
Murasame still hasn't come out.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.760
He hasn't fully recovered yet, has he?

00:04:35.510 --> 00:04:37.540
That's why I hate...

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:38.820
...children.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:45.570
I never wanted him to
see someone like that...

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.580
Not someone who sought death...

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.620
I slept great!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:59.290
I slept great, too!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.250
Shino, where's Sosuke?

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:07.670
He's with the old hag sisters
in that rundown church.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.950
I can't stand the place.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.170
Huh?

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.280
Oh, yeah! I heard that there is a

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.030
new confectionary across the way.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.470
Candy!

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:17.710
Let's check it out.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.640
Roger!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.680
You wound up getting hurt because

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.510
you felt sympathy for
that stranger, Shino.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.800
Sosuke's shadow!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:39.510
Jerk, lemme go!

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:41.440
Why do you hate me so?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.980
I, too, am Sosuke...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.210
Aren't you just a shadow?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.250
At the very least, you
aren't the Sosuke I know!

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.840
Me? Not the person you know?

00:05:57.970 --> 00:05:59.470
That isn't possible.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:03.110
Do you remember when
we went to the mountain

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:06.120
to find chestnuts for Hamaji,
who was bedridden with measles?

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:12.030
While we were out, I broke into
a fever and we got stranded.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:16.030
I must have caught the measles
from Hamaji without realizing it.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.370
To top it off, it began to rain...

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.050
You felt bad?

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.740
Why didn't you say anything?!

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.850
I didn't think I could
still catch measles...

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.150
Shino, are you all right?

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:37.620
I had them a long time ago!

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:39.920
Glad to hear it.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.850
My measles don't terrify me the way

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:45.260
the thought of you catching a cold does.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:49.880
I don't need it!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.840
Yoshiro's gonna lead Dad
here any minute now anyway.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.540
Then we'll share it.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:04.580
A birthmark...?

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.530
It's the same as mine!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:08.780
See?

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:13.570
That was when you told me, Shino,

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:18.290
"I bet we must have been brothers in a previous life."

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:22.880
Do you have any idea how
happy that made me, Shino?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.550
Shino!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.550
I was looking for you!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.800
Shino!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.050
Well, it's about time I left.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:34.500
Apparently a scary man
is hot on my trail.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:38.310
Keno... I heard that
you stole Keno's heart!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:40.810
That's right.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.310
Why would you do such a thing...?

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.990
"Why?" Because it was pretty.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:51.180
And also because it was
something I currently needed.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.130
Kohaku's...?!

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:01.290
Anything I'm lacking, I
take away from others.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:06.670
I hate to say it, but my
body is not yet complete.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.300
That other Sosuke took
most of it with him.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:16.300
Once I have everything,
that will be the time

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.690
when I go to receive
you, Shino. I promise.

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.380
He has the same face as Sosuke.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:26.420
The same voice. The same memories.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.360
What the hell is this guy?

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:48.600
Shino? Is something the matter?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.630
Sosuke...

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.760
Did ya finish up your work
with those hag sisters?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:59.210
Yes. Today they had me
help in the kitchen.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:01.640
We were giving out
sweets to the children.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.390
Sosuke...?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.220
Yes?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.690
Do you remember when we went to pick
chestnuts in the mountain,

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.210
but couldn't get back home on our own?

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:13.280
Yeah.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.640
It started to rain, so
we had to take cover...

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:16.660
That's right.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:21.460
Do you remember what
I told you back then?

00:09:22.380 --> 00:09:23.760
What you told me...?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.290
I can't say. Did you tell me something?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.980
Shino, what is this about?

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.800
Oh, nah.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:40.730
Honestly, I don't really
remember what I said either.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:45.310
Hey, you two! Headin' on back now?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.060
What's wrong, Shino? Are ya hungry?

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.130
It's not like you to look so glum.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:55.070
That's not it! Leave me alone!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.890
Shino, that was a lie.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.080
I remember what you said.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.980
Shino, you said that you
thought of me as a brother.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:20.220
How could I ever forget that?

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:25.260
I bet we must have been
brothers in a previous life.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.890
Our being brought together
wasn't just some coincidence!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.490
So, that's why...

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.530
But then you absolutely

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:37.110
insisted that you were
the older brother.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.390
And here I'm older than you...

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.370
That never sat right with me,

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:45.300
so I acted like I had forgotten
the whole conversation.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.630
Shino?!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.450
Shino?

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.040
Shino!

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.890
The usually bratty Shino is crying!

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:08.200
I'm sorry. I didn't mean
to hurt your feelings.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:21.070
KONA-YA

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.070
A summons letter from the Church?

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.570
Someone came to the
manor to pick you up,

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.080
but Kaname chased him away.

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.080
They will learn of this place
and come here before too long.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.880
Why the sudden interest in me?

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:31.710
I was under the impression

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.830
that this had been
cleared up once Mr. Satomi

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:34.840
became Shino's guardian.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.480
Word of what happened in the

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.560
red-light district has reached
the Elders of the Church.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.840
When they learned that a dead child
was amongst the living,

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.260
it sparked their interest.

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.570
You brought this upon yourself.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:48.850
What's Satomi doing about this?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.550
He went to the headquarters
and has yet to return.

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.480
I have not seen Yatsufusa, either.

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:57.160
I tried to stop him, but
Kaname has gone after him.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:00.120
We are unable to accompany him there...

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:01.910
What should we do?

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:05.720
Staying here will only cause
the innkeeper grief...

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.210
But there's no way I'm gonna do as they

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.500
like and go let them prod me over.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.380
I have a bad feeling
about all of this...

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:17.380
If they're trying to find you,

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.710
then first they
would try Mr. Satomi, the manor and then...

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.510
Hamaji!

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.590
Damn those priests!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.150
What should we do if they
lay a hand on Hamaji?

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:32.150
Isn't that a given?

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.980
We'll make them wish
they were never born!

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.170
This place always makes me feel sick.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.130
I'm amazed at how Rio can act
as though it doesn't faze him.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:49.970
Kaname?

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.290
Hamaji?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:57.320
I never expected to see you here.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.520
Shino!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.660
Are you absolutely sure it's back here?
I don't see nothin'.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.230
That would probably be
because of the barrier...

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.530
It seems rather complex.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:14.100
It isn't like Chikage's or the foxes'.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.810
It may use a different medium.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.840
It's laden with the stench of blood.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.910
Ew, yuck! Humans sure are creepy!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.250
Whoa, you scared me!

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:30.790
Yatsufusa?

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:36.600
Is that right?

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.310
Oh, so Mr. Satomi has been
in there this whole time?

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:43.830
Hamaji and Kaname are inside as well?

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:48.070
Wait! Why are you two
strikin' up a conversation?!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.970
That's so not fair!

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.260
Supposedly Kaname is with her,

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.890
so we don't have to worry about Hamaji.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.840
What should we do?

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.150
Good question!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.980
In any case,
if even Yatsufusa can't enter...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:05.170
Huh? Shino!

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.510
What was that?

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:15.500
Did something break?

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:16.750
The barrier-!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.550
It has been broken!

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.120
Master Finnegan?

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.510
This should prove most entertaining.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:41.700
This building seems kinda over the top.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:44.560
Sosuke, you go look for Hamaji!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.970
Shino, what about you?

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.640
I'll go find that idiot Satomi!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.780
How dare he let Hamaji get involved!

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.790
When I find him, I've just
gotta whack him from behind!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.770
Yatsufusa!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:01.360
You do not need to give
us a demonstration.

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:05.410
Hamaji, it looks like
your escort has arrived.

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:08.420
Those two? They caused this?

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:10.960
Oh, but this might be bad.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.670
If the barrier has been
destroyed, then ten to one,

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.680
she's going to make an appearance.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.360
A lady...?

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:18.530
Yes.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:22.510
Our Church headquarters here has
a powerful guardian angel.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.730
She is beautiful and strong...

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:29.270
This angel is so dangerous
that she'd make even

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.940
God make a mad dash barefoot.

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.700
It's unusual to see a child intruder.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:40.710
Or is your adorable form
a disguise donned by a monster?

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:42.660
What's with this chick?

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.890
I couldn't sense her coming.

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:50.340
My...

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:53.340
I see you have a most intriguing pet.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.850
Let me touch it.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.350
Lady, that's sexual harassment.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.570
I see.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.810
In that case, I shall take
my time analyzing it

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.480
after I cut off your entire arm!

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.750
For a woman, she's crazy strong!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.590
He stopped my blow...?
This child stopped me?!

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.220
No, he has merely taken
on the form of a child.

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.750
That is an interesting sword.
Where did you get it?

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.120
None of your business, you crazy lady!

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.840
Drop the sword immediately!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.510
Crap! This woman is a pain in the ass!

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.260
Don't think you can escape! Bind!

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.610
What are you?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.610
Silence will only bring
you greater agony.

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.050
Impossible... He severed
it in one strike?!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.670
Stay outta my way!

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.810
Wait, child!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:21.040
Jerk! What do you think-

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:22.890
You seem to be enjoying yourself.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.700
This is quite the perilous game of tag.

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:28.510
Forget it.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.150
There is no way I'm turning around.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.900
It truly is hard to say whether
your luck is good or bad.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.130
That guardian angel found you,

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:38.820
but you managed to escape unscathed.

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:40.410
I'm not unscathed!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.410
She nearly killed me!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.270
And does that woman look
like an angel to you?

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.170
Keep quiet.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.670
Rio!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:50.730
Lady Lilith.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:53.250
Have you seen a child?

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:54.170
No...

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:58.680
Are you certain?

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:03.680
I can smell something not
human in this general area.

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.430
Indeed?

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:09.720
I am well acquainted with this scent,
so I don't smell anything...

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:12.770
Satomi's dog spirit!

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.710
My, is that Yatsufusa?
I haven't seen it in ages.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:17.570
Brother!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.820
Brother, have you seen a child?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.330
A child...? No.

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:27.010
Lilith, did he manage
to give you the slip?

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:28.970
I let my guard down.

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:30.960
But all is well if you are unharmed.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.840
It looked as though that child
was searching for someone.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.270
And he possessed an unusual sword.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:38.840
A sword...?

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:44.410
Well, I certainly would
have loved to see it.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.570
Anyway, I'm sure I will
see him eventually.

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:51.980
Isn't that right, Rio?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.350
That aside, how do you
plan to report what

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.570
happened with the child to those elders?

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.900
Am I under any obligation
to report to them?

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.140
I swear!

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:04.740
And here I had worked so hard
to keep you from catching their attention.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.170
Now an unfortunate opponent
has taken an interest in you.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:12.110
Even you have people
that you have to bow down to.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:13.630
I'm kinda surprised.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.990
That's right.

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:19.610
This is a prime opportunity
to teach you who stands where.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:23.010
I'm not giving you any
allowance for a while!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.210
Hamaji!

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:31.600
Shino!

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.200
KONA-YA

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.550
Shino!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:25.200
Is Shino around?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.770
He isn't back yet.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:30.380
Keno, seriously, don't
be so mean to Shino.

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:32.460
Remember that he is still a child.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:33.960
Him, a kid?

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:38.140
So what if I kick the ageless
wonder around a bit?

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:39.340
I see...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.160
Anyway, I've got a boatload
of questions for him.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:44.840
Oh, that's right!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.870
I just heard about this
from the innkeeper,

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:50.810
but apparently we share another
similarity beside just our marks.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:52.600
Another similarity?

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:59.110
We were all born holding a ball
with a character inside of it.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:03.610
Wisdom

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:03.610
Mine says, "Wisdom".

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:05.360
Integrity

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:05.360
Genpachi's says, "Integrity".

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:07.370
Fraternity

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:06.850
Kobungo's says, "Fraternity".

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:09.370
Fraternity \ Integrity \ Wisdom

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.550
Kokonoe found it puzzling.

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:14.620
All of our stories
matched up so closely.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.230
And the way all of us have
gathered together like this

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:22.130
seems just a bit too contrived
to be mere coincidence.

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:25.440
I'm back! And boy am I starving.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:26.890
Sorry we're back so late.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.390
Integrity \ Fraternity \ Wisdom

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:31.390
The balls I was searching for!

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:32.530
Balls?

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.150
How come you each have one?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.150
If they were snakes, they
would have bitten us.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.060
Anything I'm lacking, I
take away from others.

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:53.910
I hate to say it, but my
body is not yet complete.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:59.370
That other Sosuke took
most of it with him.

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:04.380
Once I have everything,
that will be the time

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:07.440
when I go to receive
you, Shino. I promise.

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:11.430
He promised...

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:14.570
I like how they shine!

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:17.950
What're you doin',
Murasame?! Give 'em back!

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:18.870
No!

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:27.580
Long ago, Tamazusa plunged this
country into the Dark Ages.

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:31.680
In the battle to defeat
her, the eight young men

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:33.250
who fought alongside
Princess Fuse perished.

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:42.400
PRINCESS FUSE
EIGHT DOG WARRIORS

00:22:34.590 --> 00:22:36.940
Princess Fuse sealed
Tamazusa's soul, which had

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:39.210
turned into an evil spirit, inside her body

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:41.990
before plunging a knife
into her own chest.

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.300
When she did,

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:47.510
eight gems that were infused with
Princess Fuse's wish

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:49.540
flew to the men's next lives.

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:55.020
"Should these eight individuals ever
gather together in their future lives,

00:22:55.650 --> 00:23:00.330
"I shall come back to life
and grant their wishes."

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:05.190
Duty

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.330
Well, that leaves...

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:11.030
...one less thing for
me to take from him.

00:23:21.640 --> 00:23:23.230
She is me...

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:25.460
And I am her.

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:31.890
Back then, we had to make a choice
or we would not have survived.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:36.460
HAKKENDEN:
—Eight Dogs of the East—

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:34.970
Hakkenden: Eight Dogs of the East.

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:39.800
Season 2 starts in Summer 2013.
